Icon attribution
----------------
Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.DataExplorer/72748408781c83da507bd41ef5db254c4c637349/App/StackExchange.DataExplorer/Content/images/see_logo.png
Trademark owner: Stack Exchange Inc.
Usage: Official Stack Exchange symbol used only to identify the Stack Exchange integration. The genuine Stack Exchange speech-bubble symbol was cropped from its official 318x91 Data Explorer logo PNG at x=279, y=0, width=39, height=50, without redrawing or recoloring. Google Chrome 145.0.7632.75 proportionally upscaled the low-resolution 39x50 crop and centered it on a 512x512 transparent canvas; the original PNG is retained. This low-resolution source is explicitly recorded rather than replacing it with the Stack Overflow logo.

